Package: libfprint-goodix53x5
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, fprintd
Recommends: libpam-fprintd
Enhances: fprintd
Description: libfprint with the Goodix HTK32 (27c6:5335/5385/5395) driver for fprintd
 Builds upstream libfprint with the community goodix53x5 driver for the
 Goodix HTK32 fingerprint sensor found in the Dell XPS 13 9305, XPS 13 7390
 and XPS 15 9570 (USB IDs 27c6:5335, 27c6:5385, 27c6:5395).
 .
 The library is installed in a private directory and only fprintd is pointed
 at it, via a systemd drop-in. The distribution's libfprint-2-2 package is
 left untouched, so this package coexists with distro updates.
